WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.838
Your ideas move between apps. Your work changes.

00:00:03.818 --> 00:00:08.324
But every time you switch tools, the context gets left behind.

00:00:17.454 --> 00:00:18.727
Meet Shapr.

00:00:19.454 --> 00:00:23.672
A companion that carries the context of your work across your computer.

00:00:28.819 --> 00:00:30.569
See something important?

00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:34.365
Just circle it.

00:00:42.138 --> 00:00:44.742
Text, screenshots, documents, research.

00:00:44.722 --> 00:00:47.128
Shapr sorts them into context packs,

00:00:47.108 --> 00:00:50.704
so what you need doesn't vanish into another tab.

00:00:59.446 --> 00:01:01.194
Draft from your context.

00:01:05.846 --> 00:01:07.753
Fill in what you already know.

00:01:12.446 --> 00:01:13.734
Or just say it.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:22.798
Switch AI tools without starting over.

00:01:37.323 --> 00:01:39.081
Keep sources connected.

00:01:40.423 --> 00:01:41.879
Share on your terms.

00:01:43.423 --> 00:01:46.369
Let your AI tools use what you've collected.

00:01:52.338 --> 00:01:56.473
Next, we're designing Shapr to follow your workflow, with your permission.

00:01:56.453 --> 00:02:00.584
You choose which apps it can see, and what it's allowed to remember.

00:02:13.831 --> 00:02:16.553
Instead of starting another conversation from zero,

00:02:16.533 --> 00:02:20.433
Lens brings what you already know to the spot where you're working.

00:02:26.384 --> 00:02:28.842
Not an endless recording of your screen.

00:02:35.984 --> 00:02:37.459
A compact working memory:

00:02:37.438 --> 00:02:40.697
your goal, what you've tried, and what comes next.

00:02:48.508 --> 00:02:50.727
And when a decision gets complicated,

00:02:50.707 --> 00:02:54.327
explore the alternatives, and the evidence behind them.

00:03:05.761 --> 00:03:08.741
And when you come back, you don't have to start over.

00:03:10.811 --> 00:03:14.210
Shapr remembers the work, so you can focus on doing it.
